# VibeCheck — Complete Project Deep Dive

## At a Glance

| Attribute | Value |
|---|---|
| **Framework** | Next.js 16 (App Router) |
| **Language** | TypeScript (strict) |
| **Backend** | Supabase (Postgres + Auth + Realtime + Storage) |
| **Styling** | Tailwind CSS v4 + custom design system |
| **State/Data** | TanStack React Query, Server Components |
| **UI Components** | Custom shadcn/ui-style primitives |
| **Animations** | Framer Motion |
| **Codebase Size** | ~13,941 lines across ~80 TS/TSX files |
| **Phase** | Phase 2 in progress (MVP + community features done) |

---

## Architecture Overview

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph Client["Client (Browser)"]
        LP["Landing Page (SSR)"]
        Auth["Auth Pages (sign-in/sign-up)"]
        Dash["Dashboard (SSR + Client)"]
        Admin["Evaluator Dashboard (SSR)"]
        Public["Public Pages (profiles, badges, verify)"]
        Community["Community Feed"]
    end

    subgraph Server["Next.js Server"]
        MW["Middleware (auth guard)"]
        SC["Server Components"]
        API["API Routes (/api/*)"]
    end

    subgraph Supabase["Supabase"]
        SAuth["Auth (OAuth + Email)"]
        DB["PostgreSQL (RLS)"]
        RT["Realtime"]
        Storage["Storage (badges/certs)"]
    end

    Client --> MW --> SC --> DB
    Client --> API --> DB
    Auth --> SAuth
    MW --> SAuth
    RT -.->|"Queue updates"| Dash
    API -->|"Service role"| DB
    API --> Storage
```

