## Key Data Flows

### 1. User Signup → Dashboard

```
Sign Up → OAuth/Email → Supabase Auth
  → DB trigger: handle_new_user() creates profile
  → Middleware checks session
  → Dashboard checks onboarding_done
  → If false → 4-step onboarding (username, bio, guidelines)
  → If true → Locked/Unlocked dashboard
```

### 2. Project Submission → Evaluation

```
Submit Form (Zod validated) → POST /api/projects/submit
  → Insert into projects (status: submitted)
  → Insert into queue (auto-position via trigger)
  → Update status → in_queue
  → Create notification
  
Evaluator picks up → POST /api/admin/queue/pickup
  → Update status → evaluating
  → Assign evaluator_id

Evaluator submits → POST /api/admin/evaluations/submit
  → Insert evaluation (7 scores)
  → Update project status → evaluated
  → Remove from queue
  → Create badge
  → Send notification
```

### 3. Badge & Certificate Generation

```
POST /api/certificates/generate
  → Fetch project + evaluation + profile
  → Satori renders badge SVG → Sharp converts to PNG
  → Upload to Supabase Storage
  → Return URLs
  
GET /api/certificates/download
  → Fetch badge data
  → Stream file download
```

