## Authentication & Authorization

### Middleware ([middleware.ts](file:///Users/madhavvarshney/Desktop/Projects/vibecheck/middleware.ts))
- Refreshes Supabase session on every request
- `/dashboard/*` → requires authenticated user (redirects to `/sign-in`)
- `/admin/*` → requires authenticated user (role check deferred to layout)

### Admin Layout ([layout.tsx](file:///Users/madhavvarshney/Desktop/Projects/vibecheck/app/(admin)/layout.tsx))
- Checks `profile.is_evaluator === true`
- Redirects non-evaluators to `/dashboard`

### Supabase Client Hierarchy
| Client | File | Usage | RLS |
|---|---|---|---|
| Browser | `lib/supabase/client.ts` | Client components | ✅ Enforced |
| Server | `lib/supabase/server.ts` | Server components, SSR | ✅ Enforced |
| Service | `lib/supabase/service.ts` | Admin API routes | ❌ Bypassed |

> [!IMPORTANT]
> Evaluator operations use the **service role client** because migration 10's RLS policies were rolled back. This means admin endpoints rely on application-level auth checks rather than database-level security.

