## Design System

### Theme: Dark-first with indigo accents
- **Background**: Pure black `#000000`
- **Text**: Light gray `#e7e9ea`
- **Brand**: Indigo `#6366F1` with gradient text utility
- **Fonts**: Geist Sans + Geist Mono (Google Fonts)

### Tailwind v4 Setup
- Uses `@import 'tailwindcss'` + `@config` directive
- Custom design tokens in [tailwind.config.ts](file:///Users/madhavvarshney/Desktop/Projects/vibecheck/tailwind.config.ts):
  - Brand colors, surface colors, text hierarchy, tier colors, certificate level colors
  - Custom shadows (`glow`, `glow-lg`, `brand`, `card`)
  - Custom animations (`fade-in`, `fade-up`, `scale-in`, `shimmer`, `pulse-glow`, `float`)
- Global CSS utilities: `gradient-text`, `progress-bar`

### UI Components (CVA-based)
- `Button` — variant-based with `default`, `destructive`, `outline`, `secondary`, `ghost`, `link`
- `Badge` — status badges with variants
- `Card` — with header/content/footer composition
- `Input`, `Textarea`, `Checkbox`, `Label` — form primitives

