## Notable Technical Observations

> [!NOTE]
> 1. **Admin page is massive** — `app/(admin)/admin/page.tsx` is **32.8KB** (~800+ lines). This should be refactored into smaller components.
> 2. **Leaderboard query duplication** — The same complex ranking query appears in both `app/page.tsx` and `app/(dashboard)/dashboard/page.tsx`. Should be extracted to a shared utility.
> 3. **Service role security** — All admin operations bypass RLS via service role key. Application-level checks in API routes are the only auth boundary.
> 4. **`any` types** — `queueData` and `evaluationsData` in the dashboard page use `any[]` types instead of proper typing.
> 5. **Admin layout uses light theme** — The admin layout (`bg-gray-50`, `bg-white`) contrasts with the rest of the app which is dark-themed.
